    {
      "source": "Configure a resume <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> to resume the main sequence when polling the stream fails.",
      "translation": "配置一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>Function</code></a>，以便在轮询流失败时恢复主序列。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure a resume <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> to resume the main sequence when polling the stream fails. The function can\neither resume by suppressing the error or fail the main sequence by emitting the error to stop receiving. Receive\nerrors (Redis errors, Serialization failures) stop receiving by default.",
      "translation": "配置一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> 以在轮询流失败时恢复主序列。该函数可以通过抑制错误来恢复，或者通过向主序列发出错误以停止接收来使其失败。默认情况下，接收到的错误（如 Redis 错误或序列化失败）会停止接收。",
      "count": 1
    },
